# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile bosonic circuits {#transpile-bosonic-circuits}"
msgstr "Transpile bosonic circuit {#transpile-bosonic-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to transpile a [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") to a standard [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). A bosonic circuit carries no truncation, no encoding, and no qubit count (see [Work with bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), so the transpiler is where those choices are made. The truncation and the encoding are described by a [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") (see [Describe the truncation with a LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)), and the mapper that turns operators into qubit operators is described in [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation). The result is an ordinary [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), so any Qiskit-compatible simulator can run it.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menjelaskan cara men-transpile sebuah [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") menjadi [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) standar. Bosonic circuit tidak membawa pemotongan, encoding, maupun jumlah qubit (lihat [Bekerja dengan bosonic circuit](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), jadi Transpiler adalah tempat pilihan-pilihan itu dibuat. Pemotongan dan encoding dijelaskan oleh sebuah [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") (lihat [Mendeskripsikan pemotongan dengan LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)), dan mapper yang mengubah operator menjadi operator qubit dijelaskan di [Petakan representasi operator](mappers#mappers-explanation). Hasilnya adalah [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) biasa, jadi simulator apa pun yang kompatibel dengan Qiskit bisa menjalankannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The guide uses one small example throughout: two bosonic modes, a state with one boson in each, and a single time evolution under a Bose-Hubbard Hamiltonian whose bond and on-site terms are in separate groups (see [Group operator terms: use the operator structure](grouping#grouping-explanation)):\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini memakai satu contoh kecil dari awal sampai akhir: dua mode bosonik, sebuah state dengan satu boson di masing-masing mode, dan satu evolusi waktu di bawah Hamiltonian Bose-Hubbard yang suku bond dan on-site-nya berada di kelompok terpisah (lihat [Mengelompokkan suku operator: memanfaatkan struktur operator](grouping#grouping-explanation)):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation stages {#transpilation-stages}"
msgstr "Tahap transpilasi {#transpilation-stages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As explained in [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler\"), the preset pass managers in this package split the transpilation into the following stages:\n"
msgstr "Seperti dijelaskan di [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler\"), preset pass manager di paket ini membagi transpilasi menjadi tahap-tahap berikut:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Input** {#input}"
msgstr "**Input** {#input}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the circuit to a directed acyclic graph (DAG) data structure, the representation that every later pass works on.\n"
msgstr "Mengubah circuit menjadi struktur data directed acyclic graph (DAG), representasi tempat semua pass berikutnya bekerja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Optimization** {#optimization}"
msgstr "**Optimisasi** {#optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keeps the circuit in bosonic space. These passes use the structure of the bosonic operators, in particular their groups, while no qubit information exists yet. [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") is the pass that breaks gates down here, with a plugin for each type of gate: a product formula or qDRIFT for an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), and the Clements mesh for a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation) for how a method is chosen). [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") reorders the modes. The preset decomposes mode rotations in this stage and leaves everything else as it is.\n"
msgstr "Menjaga circuit tetap di ruang bosonik. Pass-pass ini memanfaatkan struktur operator bosonik, khususnya kelompok-kelompoknya, selagi belum ada informasi qubit. [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") adalah pass yang memecah gate di sini, dengan plugin untuk setiap jenis gate: product formula atau qDRIFT untuk sebuah [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), dan mesh Clements untuk sebuah [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") (lihat [Mensintesis gate Evolution di ruang bosonik](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation) untuk cara sebuah metode dipilih). [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") mengurutkan ulang mode. Preset mendekomposisi rotasi mode pada tahap ini dan membiarkan sisanya apa adanya.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Layout** {#layout}"
msgstr "**Tata letak** {#layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maps each bosonic mode register to a quantum register. A bosonic mode generally occupies several qubits ($d$ of them under the unary encodings, $\\lceil \\log_2 d \\rceil$ under the compact ones), so the quantum register is wider than the mode register. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") derives the register width from a [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\").\n"
msgstr "Memetakan setiap register mode bosonik ke register kuantum. Sebuah mode bosonik umumnya menempati beberapa qubit ($d$ qubit pada encoding unary, $\\lceil \\log_2 d \\rceil$ pada encoding kompak), sehingga register kuantum lebih lebar daripada register mode. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") menurunkan lebar register dari sebuah [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Synthesis** {#synthesis}"
msgstr "**Sintesis** {#synthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts bosonic gates to qubit operations, one plugin per gate type. Encoding happens in this step: the plugin for an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate maps its operator to a qubit operator, and the plugin for an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate sets the qubits that encode each occupation. A barrier is carried onto every qubit of each register it touched.\n"
msgstr "Mengubah gate bosonik menjadi operasi qubit, satu plugin per jenis gate. Encoding terjadi pada langkah ini: plugin untuk gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") memetakan operatornya menjadi operator qubit, dan plugin untuk gate [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") mengatur qubit yang meng-encode setiap okupansi. Sebuah barrier diteruskan ke setiap qubit dari setiap register yang disentuhnya.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qubit** {#qubit}"
msgstr "**Qubit** {#qubit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiles the resulting qubit circuit with Qiskit’s own methods, for example to a basis gate set or a device. The preset always includes it; by default it is Qiskit’s preset pass manager, which synthesizes every evolution into gates (see [Continue on the qubit level](#transpilation-qubit-stage)).\n"
msgstr "Men-transpile circuit qubit yang dihasilkan dengan metode Qiskit sendiri, misalnya ke basis gate set atau sebuah device. Preset selalu menyertakannya; secara bawaan ia adalah preset pass manager milik Qiskit, yang mensintesis setiap evolusi menjadi gate (lihat [Melanjutkan di level qubit](#transpilation-qubit-stage)).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Output** {#output}"
msgstr "**Output** {#output}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the internal DAG data structure back to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"
msgstr "Mengubah struktur data DAG internal kembali menjadi [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The truncation and the encoding are not stored in the circuit. They are given to the transpiler, and the layout, the state preparation, and the mapper must all agree on them. The preset ensures that by handing the same [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") to all three.\n"
msgstr "Pemotongan dan encoding tidak disimpan di dalam circuit. Keduanya diberikan ke Transpiler, dan layout, persiapan state, serta mapper harus sepakat tentang keduanya. Preset memastikannya dengan memberikan [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") yang sama ke ketiganya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "A practical example {#a-practical-example}"
msgstr "Contoh praktis {#a-practical-example}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") builds the pipeline from a spec. Lowering the example under two encodings only changes the spec. The preset ends in Qiskit’s own qubit-level transpilation, which would synthesize the evolution into gates. To see the circuit exactly as the bosonic stages emit it, empty that stage first:\n"
msgstr "[`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") membangun pipeline dari sebuah spec. Menurunkan contoh di bawah dua encoding hanya mengubah spec-nya. Preset berakhir pada transpilasi level qubit milik Qiskit sendiri, yang akan mensintesis evolusi menjadi gate. Untuk melihat circuit persis seperti yang dihasilkan tahap bosonik, kosongkan dulu tahap itu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two encodings use six and four qubits respectively (three levels per mode under the unary encoding, two qubits per mode under the Gray code), but the structure of the circuit is the same: two [`XGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate) operations prepare the occupations, and one [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) carries the evolution.\n"
msgstr "Kedua encoding masing-masing memakai enam dan empat qubit (tiga level per mode pada encoding unary, dua qubit per mode pada kode Gray), tetapi struktur circuit-nya sama: dua operasi [`XGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate) menyiapkan okupansi, dan satu [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) membawa evolusinya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the traditional workflow {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"
msgstr "Bandingkan dengan alur kerja tradisional {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation) guide describes the traditional workflow, which maps the Hamiltonian to a qubit operator *before* it builds the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). The two routes produce equivalent circuits. They differ in what has to be redone when the truncation changes. The bosonic circuit is built once and lowered at every cutoff, whereas the map-first route needs the operator mapped again and the circuit rebuilt:\n"
msgstr "Panduan [bosonic circuit](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation) menjelaskan alur kerja tradisional, yang memetakan Hamiltonian ke operator qubit *sebelum* membangun [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). Kedua jalur menghasilkan circuit yang ekuivalen. Bedanya ada pada apa yang harus diulang ketika pemotongan berubah. Bosonic circuit dibangun sekali dan diturunkan di setiap cutoff, sedangkan jalur map-first membutuhkan operator dipetakan lagi dan circuit dibangun ulang:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The entangling-gate count depends on how Qiskit synthesizes the evolution gate, which changes between releases, so plot it:\n"
msgstr "Jumlah gate pengentang bergantung pada bagaimana Qiskit mensintesis gate evolusi, yang berubah antar rilis, jadi plot-lah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![CX count of the lowered circuit against the number of levels d, growing quickly with d.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-bosons/transpilation-4.avif)\n"
msgstr "![CX count of the lowered circuit against the number of levels d, growing quickly with d.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-bosons/transpilation-4.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The count grows quickly with the cutoff, which is the reason to keep the cutoff a parameter of the transpilation and not of the circuit. The two routes are equivalent here, but only the bosonic one can also interleave the grouping of the operator with the product formula (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation)) or hand the encoding to a different spec without changing a line of the circuit.\n"
msgstr "Jumlahnya tumbuh cepat seiring cutoff, dan itulah alasan menjadikan cutoff sebagai parameter transpilasi dan bukan parameter circuit. Kedua jalur ekuivalen di sini, tetapi hanya jalur bosonik yang juga bisa menyisipkan pengelompokan operator dengan product formula (lihat [Mensintesis gate Evolution di ruang bosonik](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation)) atau menyerahkan encoding ke spec lain tanpa mengubah satu baris pun dari circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A spec with a single cutoff leaves the number of modes open, so one pass manager serves circuits of any width. A spec with one cutoff per mode fixes the width:\n"
msgstr "Spec dengan satu cutoff membiarkan jumlah mode terbuka, sehingga satu pass manager melayani circuit dengan lebar berapa pun. Spec dengan satu cutoff per mode menetapkan lebarnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the pipeline by hand {#build-the-pipeline-by-hand}"
msgstr "Membangun pipeline secara manual {#build-the-pipeline-by-hand}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset is a [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) with one entry per stage. You can assemble the same pipeline from its parts, which is the starting point for every customization below:\n"
msgstr "Preset-nya adalah [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) dengan satu entri per stage. Kamu bisa merakit pipeline yang sama dari bagian-bagiannya, yang menjadi titik awal untuk setiap kustomisasi di bawah ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The mapper function receives an operator and the width of the register that the layout derived, and returns a [`SparseObservable`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparseObservable). Because it is given the width, passing `num_qubits` on to [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") makes the mapper check that the spec fits the register, so a mismatch between the layout and the encoding fails with a clear message.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi mapper menerima sebuah operator dan lebar register yang diturunkan oleh layout, lalu mengembalikan sebuah [`SparseObservable`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparseObservable). Karena lebar register diberikan, meneruskan `num_qubits` ke [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") membuat mapper memeriksa apakah spec cocok dengan register, sehingga ketidakcocokan antara layout dan encoding akan gagal dengan pesan yang jelas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced workflows {#advanced-workflows}"
msgstr "Alur kerja lanjutan {#advanced-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provide an explicit layout {#provide-an-explicit-layout}"
msgstr "Berikan layout secara eksplisit {#provide-an-explicit-layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`CustomB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-custom-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout\") replaces the layout stage with a mapping that you provide, from each bosonic register of the circuit to a quantum register. It is useful when the register must be wider than the spec needs, for example to leave idle qubits for other purposes:\n"
msgstr "[`CustomB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-custom-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout\") menggantikan stage layout dengan pemetaan yang kamu berikan, dari setiap register bosonik pada circuit ke sebuah register kuantum. Ini berguna ketika register harus lebih lebar daripada yang dibutuhkan spec, misalnya untuk menyisakan qubit menganggur untuk keperluan lain:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Warning\" type=\"caution\">\n"
"  A custom layout is your responsibility. The synthesis plugins still address qubits through the spec, so a register that does not match the spec’s widths gives a wrong circuit or an error deep inside a plugin. A custom layout also skips the check that [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") performs after [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") (see the next section).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Peringatan\" type=\"caution\">\n"
"  Layout kustom jadi tanggung jawabmu. Plugin synthesis tetap mengakses qubit lewat spec, jadi register yang tidak cocok dengan lebar di spec akan menghasilkan circuit yang salah atau error jauh di dalam plugin. Layout kustom juga melewati pemeriksaan yang dilakukan [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") setelah [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") (lihat bagian berikutnya).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reorder the modes {#reorder-the-modes}"
msgstr "Urutkan ulang mode {#reorder-the-modes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") is an optimization-stage pass that reorders the modes. The permutation is read as a mapping from original to new mode index, and it is recorded in the circuit metadata. The reordering changes which qubits each mode occupies, and so it can reduce the depth of the lowered circuit.\n"
msgstr "[`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") adalah pass tahap optimisasi yang mengurutkan ulang mode. Permutasinya dibaca sebagai pemetaan dari indeks mode asli ke indeks mode baru, dan dicatat di metadata circuit. Pengurutan ulang mengubah qubit mana yang ditempati tiap mode, sehingga bisa mengurangi depth circuit hasil lowering.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the result is expressed in the new mode order, measured bitstrings must be mapped back before they are interpreted. With several qubits per mode, the mapping acts on blocks of qubits and not on single bits. The following example relabels three modes, each occupying two qubits under the Gray code, and recovers the original occupation from the measured counts:\n"
msgstr "Karena hasilnya dinyatakan dalam urutan mode yang baru, bitstring hasil pengukuran harus dipetakan kembali sebelum ditafsirkan. Dengan beberapa qubit per mode, pemetaan bekerja pada blok qubit, bukan pada bit tunggal. Contoh berikut me-relabel tiga mode, masing-masing menempati dua qubit di bawah kode Gray, dan memulihkan okupansi asli dari counts hasil pengukuran:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The restored bitstring is what the circuit produces without the relabeling, read in Qiskit’s little-endian order: mode 0 holds the Gray code of level two (`11`), mode 1 holds level zero (`00`), and mode 2 holds level one (`01`).\n"
msgstr "Bitstring yang dipulihkan adalah apa yang dihasilkan circuit tanpa relabeling, dibaca dalam urutan little-endian Qiskit: mode 0 menyimpan kode Gray level dua (`11`), mode 1 menyimpan level nol (`00`), dan mode 2 menyimpan level satu (`01`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Warning\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Peringatan\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  A spec that gives the modes **different** cutoffs cannot be combined with [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\"). The cutoffs are attached to the modes by their position, so reordering the modes would put a cutoff on the wrong mode. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") refuses a relabeled circuit in that case:\n"
msgstr "  Spec yang memberi mode cutoff **berbeda** tidak bisa dikombinasikan dengan [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\"). Cutoff dikaitkan ke mode berdasarkan posisinya, jadi mengurutkan ulang mode akan menaruh cutoff di mode yang salah. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") menolak circuit yang sudah di-relabel dalam kasus itu:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the synthesis plugins {#choose-the-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Pilih plugin synthesis {#choose-the-synthesis-plugins}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") has no default plugins; the preset registers one per gate type. The available plugins are managed by [`B2QSynthesisPluginManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-synthesis-b-2-q-synthesis-plugin-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager\"), which lists them by the name of the gate they act on:\n"
msgstr "[`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") tidak punya plugin default; preset mendaftarkan satu per tipe gate. Plugin yang tersedia dikelola oleh [`B2QSynthesisPluginManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-synthesis-b-2-q-synthesis-plugin-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager\"), yang mendaftarkannya berdasarkan nama gate yang mereka tangani:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two builtin methods are `Evolution.MapperFn` and `InitializeModes.Occupation`. The first synthesizes an evolution from any mapper function, which is how a custom encoding is plugged in (see [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation)). The library ships no plugin for a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") gate. The preset breaks it down in bosonic space into [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gates first, which the first method then handles, but a plugin registered for `ModeRotation` can lower the gate directly instead; see [Rotate bosonic modes](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-explanation) and [Lower a rotation without decomposing it](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-direct-explanation). You can register a method by name through the `config` argument of [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\"), or write a plugin object into [`B2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods\") directly, as the preceding examples do.\n"
msgstr "Dua metode bawaan adalah `Evolution.MapperFn` dan `InitializeModes.Occupation`. Yang pertama mensintesis sebuah evolusi dari fungsi mapper apa pun, dan inilah cara memasang encoding kustom (lihat [Petakan representasi operator](mappers#mappers-explanation)). Library ini tidak menyertakan plugin untuk gate [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\"). Preset menguraikannya di ruang bosonik menjadi gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") terlebih dulu, yang kemudian ditangani metode pertama, tetapi plugin yang didaftarkan untuk `ModeRotation` bisa menurunkan gate itu secara langsung; lihat [Rotasikan mode bosonik](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-explanation) dan [Turunkan rotasi tanpa mendekomposisinya](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-direct-explanation). Kamu bisa mendaftarkan sebuah metode berdasarkan nama lewat argumen `config` dari [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\"), atau menulis objek plugin langsung ke [`B2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods\"), seperti pada contoh-contoh sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"transpilation-qubit-stage\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Continue on the qubit level {#continue-on-the-qubit-level}"
msgstr "Lanjutkan di level qubit {#continue-on-the-qubit-level}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset always ends in a `qubit` stage, which is Qiskit’s own preset pass manager. Keyword arguments of [`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") are handed to [`qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), so you can translate to a basis gate set or target a device directly. Prefer `optimization_level=0` to keep the circuit close to what the bosonic stages produced:\n"
msgstr "Preset selalu berakhir di stage `qubit`, yaitu pass manager preset milik Qiskit sendiri. Keyword argument dari [`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") diteruskan ke [`qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), jadi kamu bisa menerjemahkan ke basis gate set atau menargetkan perangkat secara langsung. Sebaiknya gunakan `optimization_level=0` agar circuit tetap dekat dengan hasil stage bosonik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two other choices are common. Assign an empty [`PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) to the `qubit` stage when you want to show the circuit exactly as the pipeline synthesized it, as the examples above do. Or assemble the pipeline yourself and add any Qiskit pass manager as the `qubit` stage of the [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager). Stages run in the order they are given, so the `qubit` stage must come before `output`, because Qiskit’s passes expect a DAG and not a finished circuit:\n"
msgstr "Ada dua pilihan lain yang umum. Berikan [`PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) kosong ke stage `qubit` kalau kamu ingin menampilkan circuit persis seperti yang disintesis pipeline, seperti pada contoh di atas. Atau rakit pipeline sendiri dan tambahkan pass manager Qiskit apa pun sebagai stage `qubit` dari [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager). Stage dijalankan sesuai urutan yang diberikan, jadi stage `qubit` harus berada sebelum `output`, karena pass Qiskit mengharapkan DAG, bukan circuit jadi:\n"

